  "releaseNotes": "- **An endpoint refused because another process runs it names what the holder holds its process lock for, which process, on which machine, and since when:** `EndpointAlreadyRunningInAnotherProcessException`'s message says \"held for running the endpoint Orders, by process 4242 (Orders.Host) on SERVER7, since 2026-11-26 10:15:00 +01:00\", where it said \"held by process 4242 on SERVER7\". The process lock is one of the domain database's process locks, from Compze.Sql.MicrosoftSql and its siblings.",
